I think of the good times we have shared, 

With a smile on my face, I begin to reminisce, 

I remember when you held me at your house, 

Playing with all the games you owned. 


& nbsp; 



A long time has passed, I know, 

And I would love to see you once more, 

So when you call, take me there, 

For I want to reminisce once more. 


& nbsp; 



A long time has passed, I know, 

We should not have let our love die, 

So now I will move my heart back, 

To once again be with my love. 


& nbsp; 



Now it 's time for me to be back, 

To where I used to live, 

Now I 'm glad I came here, 

And I 'm sad that it 's ended. 


& nbsp; 



I 'll be back for the things I love, 

But you must learn that I need you, 

I may be able to do that here, 

But not to the level of before. 


